If your Audi’s issue cannot be repaired by the manufacturer (after a reasonable number of repair attempts), you may be eligible for benefits under your state’s lemon law.

As an [Audi lemon law lawyer](/manufacturers/audi) in California, we want to take the opportunity to discuss the Audi models with the most lemon law complaints and recalls. Additionally, we’ll explain the qualifications for the lemon law process if you’re dealing with recurring issues.

