The Audi A4, one of the automaker’s most popular compact executive cars, has earned a great reputation for its performance, handling, and [luxury features](/blog/lemon-law-protections-for-high-end-vehicles-in-los-angeles) since its launch in 1994 through its final model in 2025.

With five generations of the A4, this model has been widely praised by critics. However, the Audi A4 has not been immune to significant recalls. With [26 total recalls](https://www.cars.com/research/audi-a3/recalls/), the A4 has had issues with:

