The Audi Q5, first launched in 2008, is a compact luxury crossover SUV that has become one of Audi’s best sellers. Known for practicality, performance, and upscale design, the Q5 has earned praise from critics across the board. However, despite its success, the [Q5 has been recalled 33 times](https://www.cars.com/research/audi-a3/recalls/), with several recurring issues:

