The Audi A3, first introduced as one of the top Audi cars in 1996, is a compact luxury vehicle that offers a stylish, sporty design combined with Audi’s renowned performance.

It’s earned accolades, including being [named World Car of the Year in 2014](https://www.topgear.com/car-news/new-york-motor-show/audi-a3-wins-world-car-year). However, the A3 has racked up [29 recalls over the years](https://www.cars.com/research/audi-a3/recalls/). Some of the most common issues reported by Audi owners with the A3 include:

